o open               pick a worktree, or start a new branch off {default_branch}
c open-current       pick a worktree, or start a new branch off {current_branch}
r open-with-remotes  pick a worktree, or start a new branch off a local or remote branch
-
m merge              merge into the target branch
M merge-no-squash    merge into the target branch, keeping every commit
x remove             remove a worktree
